<title>USA: Steven Madden Ltd Q1 same-store sales rise.</title>
<headline>Steven Madden Ltd Q1 same-store sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steven Madden Ltd said first quarter same-store sales increased 23.2 percent to nearly $800 million.</p>
<p>The company said its two new mall stores at Roosevelt Field on Long Island, N.Y. and Garden State Plaza in Paramus, N.J. continue to exceed projections.</p>
<p>Steven Madden said it also signed a new retail lease for Steve Madden Retail Stores at Queens Center Mall in Elmhurst, N.Y.</p>
</text>
